<title>UK: Yamaichi prices $172 mln Tokyo Dome warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi prices $172 mln Tokyo Dome warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The strike price on the following bond with equity warrants has been set by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BE GLOBAL LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  FUJI BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT     $172.25 MLN  COUPON     3.875     MATURITY    17.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE    STRAIGHT/WW  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 10 (+2W)  SALE LIMS  US/GB/JP/CI</p>
<p> CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p> NOTES	WARRANT EXERCISE PERIOD -- 31.JUL.97-10.JUL.01</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PREMIUM OF 2.5 PERCENT. POSSIBLE DOWNWARD</p>
<p>		REVISION ON 04.DEC.98 WITH 80 PCT FLOOR.</p>
<p>		THE WARRANTS ARE EXERCISABLE INTO SHARES IN TOKYO</p>
<p>DOME</p>
<p>		CORP.</p>
<p>		STRIKE PRICE 1,589 YEN (2 WARRANTS PER BOND)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
